[I] Direct3D 12 to Vulkan translation library

[T] vkd3d is a 3D graphics library built on top of Vulkan with an API very
[T] similar to Direct3D 12, developed by the Wine project. It also contains
[T] vkd3d-shader, a library for translating and compiling HLSL and Direct3D
[T] shader bytecode, and is used by Wine to implement Direct3D 12.

[U] https://www.winehq.org

[A] Vkd3d Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

